OL,3,GNEWSALanguage celebration makes        
OL,4,A'biggest year yet for Manx'            
OL,6,FA "whole new section" of the Isle of   
OL,7,FMan community have been put in touch   
OL,8,Fwith the Isle of Man's native language 
OL,9,Fthrough a year-long celebration of it, 
OL,10,FCulture Vannin has said.               
OL,12,FBlein ny Gaelgey - Year of the Manx    
OL,13,FLanguage - marks the last major event  
OL,14,Fin its calendar in Peel this Saturday  
OL,15,Fin a joint event with the local        
OL,16,Fauthority which includes the town's    
OL,17,FChristmas lights switch-on.            
