OL,3,GNEWSALanguage celebration makes        
OL,4,A'biggest year yet for Manx'            
OL,6,FCoordinator for the 12-month           
OL,7,Fcelebration of Manx Gaelic Tiffany     
OL,8,FKerruish said the aim was to inspire   
OL,9,Fthe community to learn about the       
OL,10,Flanguage and use it.                   
OL,12,FShe said it had proved to be the       
OL,13,F"biggest year yet" for adult learners  
OL,14,Fthrough the organisation's annual      
OL,15,Fsummer school.                         
